get.summary:
This action returns the admin sign-in limiter settings in effect, as loaded at startup;
a saved change shows here only after a restart. Requires
`adminloginratelimit:read`.

post.summary:
This action creates a block or allow list. A subscribed list needs a subscription URL;
the URL and refresh interval are dropped for a local list. Returns 400 for a missing
name or URL and 409 when the name is taken. Requires `filterlists:write`.

ReverseProxySettingsDetail.description:
This record is the reverse proxy trust configuration that
`GET /api/reverse-proxy-settings` returns. The shared secret is never returned;
Ninlil.Web.Models.ReverseProxySettingsDetail.SharedSecretConfigured says whether one is set, as
`TwoFactorStatus.HasAuthenticator` does for an authenticator. A `PATCH` accepts
these fields with `sharedSecret` in place of Ninlil.Web.Models.ReverseProxySettingsDetail.SharedSecretConfigured;
the last two fields are read-only.
